= Projects

What the Edge AI Lab is working on, and what it has finished. Funded projects and the grants
behind them are listed on [awards.html Awards & Grants].

== Current

- *Distributionally robust semantic communication.* Making a semantic link hold up when the
  channel and the task distribution both drift away from the training conditions.
- *Federated and edge learning under limited communication.* Reducing what has to be sent
  without giving up the accuracy the application needs.
- *Adaptive video streaming over multipath and cache-enabled networks.* Choosing a
  representation and a path together, rather than one after the other.

== Completed

- *Network utility maximization in interference-limited wireless networks.* The structure of
  the optimal allocation, and algorithms that find it from limited channel state information.
- *Content caching and delivery in mobile networks.* Where to place content when both the
  demand and the topology move.

